   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2021-04-20",
   "text": "Freedom from Price Gouging Act\n This bill requires drug manufacturers to issue rebates to the Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services for covered drugs under Medicare that cost $100 or more and for which the average manufacturer price increases faster than inflation."
